# Tor configuration for HiveRelay onion transport
#
# This file is a template — the tor sidecar reads it at startup.
# The HiveRelay tor transport connects to the control port and
# creates a v3 onion service programmatically via ADD_ONION.
#
# Pin: tor 0.4.9.x (0.4.8 hard-sunset 2026-09-01).
# ML-KEM768 hybrid channel crypto shipped in 0.4.8.17.
# A rendezvous MitM fix shipped in 0.4.9.11 (2026-06-25).
# Currency is a security property — keep tor updated.

# ─── Sockets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SOCKS5 proxy for outbound Tor connections (relay → peers via Tor)
SocksPort 9050

# Control port for ADD_ONION / SETCONF (HiveRelay transport connects here)
ControlPort 9051
# Cookie auth — the transport reads the cookie file to authenticate
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile /var/lib/tor/control_auth_cookie

# ─── Hidden service ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The onion service is created dynamically by HiveRelay via ADD_ONION
# on the control port. Persistent keys are managed by the transport
# (ED25519-V3:<blob> restore). Do NOT configure HiddenServiceDir here —
# it would conflict with the dynamic ADD_ONION path.

# ─── PoW defense (prop 327) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Enabled by default for public-advertised relays.
# Authorized clients (restricted discovery) bypass the puzzle.
# Note: daemon-wide via SETCONF, not per-service.
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServicePoWQueueRate 200
HiddenServicePoWQueueBurst 400

# ─── Vanguards ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lite vanguards (one extra fixed L2 guard) is core-default for onion
# circuits. Guard discovery is a live threat (PoPETs 2022; arXiv 2602.23560).
# Explicitly set to lite for clarity.
Vanguards lite

# ─── Logging ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Minimal logging — the transport handles its own structured logs.
# NEVER log at debug in production (leaks circuit metadata).
Log notice stderr
SafeLogging 1

# ─── Concurrency ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Concurrency is good since 0.4.7 (prop 324). Default is fine.
# Conflux multipath does NOT help onion services today.

# ─── Data directory ────────────────────────────────────────────────
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

# ─── Security hardening ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drop privileges (tor runs as the tor user inside the container)
User tor
